WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,250
You go back first

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,060
I gotta keep an eye on that guy.

3
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,420
Why did the boss ask you to come over and help?

4
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,820
These things are very heavy

5
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,300
How can we let them carry heavy things?

6
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,100
I was just kidding

7
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,060
Put it in front of the ink room

8
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,540
Are you really going to be caught?

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:36,960
Who secretly stockpiles so many weapons?

10
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:40,560
Who is this guy at this age?

11
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,240
You'll be caught joking

12
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:46,720
What do you two encourage Gulu to say? It’s just flirting.
